BT /F2 15 Tf 50 771.75 Td (3. Consent Form A - Student Visitor Consent) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 50 727.3 Td (Purpose P3: Contact a Landlord by WhatsApp or Email) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50.0 699.1 Td (When you click a "Contact via WhatsApp" or "Contact via Email" button on a listing page, you) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50.0 685.6 Td (are giving your explicit consent for the following:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 660.1 Td (1. Your phone number \(for WhatsApp\) or email address \(for email\) and any message you choose) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 646.6 Td (   to send will be transmitted directly to the landlord/agent and to the messaging provider) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 633.1 Td (   \(Meta Platforms Ireland Ltd. for WhatsApp; your email provider for email\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 619.6 Td (2. UniHub does not receive, store, or have access to the content of your message or your) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 606.1 Td (   contact details at any point.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 592.6 Td (3. The button clearly names its destination \(e.g., "Open in WhatsApp" or "Send Email"\) so you) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 579.1 Td (   know where your data is going before you click.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 565.6 Td (4. An email alternative is always offered beside the WhatsApp button, so you can choose the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 552.1 Td (   channel you prefer.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 538.6 Td (5. No form on the UniHub site collects your contact details. The hand-off is a direct link) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 525.1 Td (   that opens your WhatsApp or email application.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 511.6 Td (6. You may choose not to click the button. Browsing listings, filtering, and viewing the map) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 498.1 Td (   work fully without contacting any landlord.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 50 452.3999999999999 Td (CONSENT DECLARATION - STUDENT) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50.0 426.2 Td (By clicking the "Contact via WhatsApp" or "Contact via Email" button on a UniHub listing page,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50.0 412.7 Td (I confirm that:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 393.2 Td (Х  I have read and understood this consent information.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 379.7 Td (Х  I understand that my phone number/email and message will go to the landlord/agent and to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 366.2 Td (   WhatsApp/email provider, not to UniHub.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 352.7 Td (Х  I understand that I can use the email alternative if I prefer not to use WhatsApp.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 339.2 Td (Х  I understand that I am not required to contact any landlord to use the discovery features) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 325.7 Td (   of the site.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 312.2 Td (Х  I freely give this consent by the clear affirmative act of clicking the button.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50.0 278.7 Td (Implementation Note: Consent is obtained through the user interface at the point of action) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50.0 265.2 Td (\(button click\). No separate checkbox or form is presented, as the button itself constitutes the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50.0 251.7 Td ("clear affirmative act" described in the Act and Guidance Note. The button text names the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50.0 238.2 Td (destination and purpose \(e.g., "Contact Landlord via WhatsApp - Opens WhatsApp with pre-filled) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50.0 224.7 Td (message"\).) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
