BT /F1 10 Tf 50.0 672.1 Td (legitimate interests \(Section 30\(1\)\(b\) of the Act\) as the landlord has initiated contact.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50.0 658.6 Td (However, the following information is provided for transparency:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 633.1 Td (Х  Data collected: Your WhatsApp sender number and the content of your conversation with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 619.6 Td (   UniHub.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 606.1 Td (Х  Purpose: To evaluate your interest in listing a property, discuss listing details, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 592.6 Td (   proceed to the formal authorisation \(Consent Form B\) if you wish to publish.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 579.1 Td (Х  Storage: Conversations are held in UniHub's WhatsApp account and on the founder's device.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 565.6 Td (   Proposed retention: deleted 6 months after the listing decision.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 552.1 Td (Х  No automated decision-making: The decision to publish or decline a listing is made by a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 538.6 Td (   person after review, not automatically. Reasons are given on request.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 525.1 Td (Х  International transfer: WhatsApp is operated by Meta Platforms Ireland Ltd. Messages are) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 511.6 Td (   processed under Meta's terms and privacy policy.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 498.1 Td (Х  You may stop messaging at any time. To request deletion of your conversation data, contact) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 484.6 Td (   shadrack@unihub.ke.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 50 438.8999999999999 Td (ACKNOWLEDGEMENT - LANDLORD ENQUIRY) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50.0 412.7 Td (By messaging UniHub on WhatsApp to enquire about listing a property, I acknowledge that:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 393.2 Td (Х  I have initiated this contact voluntarily.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 379.7 Td (Х  My WhatsApp number and message content will be processed by UniHub for the purpose of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 366.2 Td (   evaluating a potential listing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 352.7 Td (Х  I have been informed of the retention period \(6 months after listing decision\) and my right) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 339.2 Td (   to request deletion.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 325.7 Td (Х  I understand that if I proceed to publish a listing, a separate written authorisation) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 312.2 Td (   \(Consent Form B\) will be required.) Tj ET
endstream
