BT /F2 15 Tf 50 771.75 Td (7. Rights of Data Subjects) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50.0 739.5 Td (Under the Data Protection Act, No. 24 of 2019 and the Data Protection \(General\) Regulations,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50.0 726.0 Td (2021, data subjects have the following rights:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 706.5 Td (1. Right to be informed - to receive clear information about what data is processed, by whom,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 693.0 Td (   on what basis, where it is hosted, how long it is kept, and how to complain \(Action A4:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 679.5 Td (   privacy notice published before launch\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 666.0 Td (2. Right of access - to request a copy of personal data held. A student who asks what UniHub) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 652.5 Td (   holds is told that nothing is held. A landlord's listing data is provided on request.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 639.0 Td (3. Right to rectification - to have inaccurate data corrected. A landlord's listing is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 625.5 Td (   corrected on request \(Action A7\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 612.0 Td (4. Right to erasure / withdrawal - to have data deleted or consent withdrawn. A landlord may) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 598.5 Td (   withdraw listing consent at any time; the listing is removed within 48 hours \(Action A7\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 585.0 Td (   A student's contact hand-off is a one-time act; no data is retained by UniHub to erase.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 571.5 Td (5. Right to object - to object to processing based on legitimate interests \(P1, P2, P4, P6\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 558.0 Td (   Objections are assessed and acted upon within the time limits set by the Act and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 544.5 Td (   Regulations.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 531.0 Td (6. Right to data portability - to receive data in a structured, commonly used format.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 517.5 Td (   Applicable to landlord listing data and conversation records.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 504.0 Td (7. Right not to be subject to automated decision-making - UniHub makes no automated decisions) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 490.5 Td (   about any student or landlord \(P1-P6\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 477.0 Td (8. Right to complain - to the Office of the Data Protection Commissioner \(ODPC\), Kenya.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 50 431.3 Td (How to Exercise Rights) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50.0 405.1 Td (A single named contact point is published on the site and in all communications:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 385.6 Td (Х  Email: shadrack@unihub.ke) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 372.1 Td (Х  WhatsApp: [UniHub WhatsApp number - displayed on site]) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 358.6 Td (Х  Requests are logged on receipt and actioned within the time limits set by the Act and the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 345.1 Td (   Data Protection \(General\) Regulations, 2021 \(to be confirmed by the Data Protection) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 331.6 Td (   Officer\).) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
