BT /F2 15 Tf 50 771.75 Td (8. Withdrawal of Consent) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 50 723.3 Td (Student Consent \(P3\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50.0 703.1 Td (Student consent for the WhatsApp/email hand-off is a one-time act at the moment of clicking the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50.0 689.6 Td (button. No ongoing consent is stored by UniHub. The student may simply choose not to click the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50.0 676.1 Td (button in future. Since UniHub does not receive or store the student's contact details or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50.0 662.6 Td (message content, there is no data held by UniHub to withdraw.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 50 616.8999999999999 Td (Landlord/Agent Consent \(P5\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50.0 596.7 Td (The landlord or agent may withdraw their written consent for publication at any time, without) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50.0 583.2 Td (giving a reason, by:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 563.7 Td (Х  Emailing shadrack@unihub.ke with the listing reference and a statement of withdrawal.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 550.2 Td (Х  Messaging the UniHub WhatsApp number with the listing reference and a statement of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 536.7 Td (   withdrawal.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50.0 519.2 Td (Upon receipt of a withdrawal request, UniHub will:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 499.7 Td (1. Log the request, date, and action taken \(Action A7\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 486.2 Td (2. Remove the listing from the live site within 48 hours.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 472.7 Td (3. Confirm removal to the landlord/agent.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 459.2 Td (4. The listing data in the code repository will be removed in the next deployment cycle.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 50 413.49999999999983 Td (Landlord Enquiry Data \(P4\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50.0 393.3 Td (A landlord who has messaged UniHub on WhatsApp may request deletion of their conversation data) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50.0 379.8 Td (at any time by contacting shadrack@unihub.ke. The data will be deleted from UniHub's WhatsApp) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50.0 366.3 Td (account and the founder's device within the statutory time limits.) Tj ET
endstream
